type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L125","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types.ts:125"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Select from full table state. Re-renders when the selected value changes\n(shallow compare)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required in store mode so you never accidentally subscribe to the whole\nstore without an explicit projection."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"state","children":[{"type":"text","value":"state"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"source","children":[{"type":"text","value":"source"}]},{"type":"code","value":"source: SubscribeSource<ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableState_FeatureMap>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L117","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types.ts:117"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-subscribepropswithstoretfeatures-tselected","text":"Interface: SubscribePropsWithStore<TFeatures, TSelected>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":3},{"id":"selector","text":"selector()","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"source","text":"source","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: SubscribePropsWithStore\\<TFeatures, TSelected\\>\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:113](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L113)\n\nSubscribe to `table.store` (full table state). The selector receives the full\nTableState.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected`\n\n## Properties\n\n### children\n\n```ts\nchildren:\n  | SubscribeStaticChild\n  | (state) => unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L126)\n\n***\n\n### selector()\n\n```ts\nselector: (state) => TSelected;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:125](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L125)\n\nSelect from full table state. Re-renders when the selected value changes\n(shallow compare).\n\nRequired in store mode so you never accidentally subscribe to the whole\nstore without an explicit projection.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### state\n\n`TableState`\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TSelected`\n\n***\n\n### source\n\n```ts\nsource: SubscribeSource<ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableState_FeatureMap>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:117](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L117)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SubscribePropsWithStore\ntitle: SubscribePropsWithStore\n---\n\n# Interface: SubscribePropsWithStore\\<TFeatures, TSelected\\>\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:113](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L113)\n\nSubscribe to `table.store` (full table state). The selector receives the full\nTableState.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected`\n\n## Properties\n\n### children\n\n```ts\nchildren:\n  | SubscribeStaticChild\n  | (state) => unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L126)\n\n***\n\n### selector()\n\n```ts\nselector: (state) => TSelected;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:125](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L125)\n\nSelect from full table state. Re-renders when the selected value changes\n(shallow compare).\n\nRequired in store mode so you never accidentally subscribe to the whole\nstore without an explicit projection.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### state\n\n`TableState`\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TSelected`\n\n***\n\n### source\n\n```ts\nsource: SubscribeSource<ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableState_FeatureMap>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types.ts:117](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/types.ts#L117)\n"}
